  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "THE GAUGE\n\nA and B are live numbers.\n\nSync dozes on A's events;\neach change flies to B\nwearing a set badge. Control\ndoes the same the other way.\n\nChange EITHER -- drop a\nnumber on it, or send its\nbird a badge -- and the\nother follows.\n\nThe echo rule is why this\nring does not ring forever:\na set that changes nothing\nis swallowed, so the circle\nstops after one lap."
   },
   "x": -1.55,
   "z": 1.7
  },
  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "TO RUN IT\n\nPull both levers up.\n\nDrop a +3 on A. Watch B\nfollow. Drop a \u00d72 on B.\nWatch A follow.\n\nThe events nests keep the\nhistory: every value each\nnumber has passed through,\nnewest underneath."
   },
